ModernMavericks/swift-toolchain

This repository builds and republishes host build tooling for constructing a
Swift runtime targeting Mac OS X 10.9. It ships two kinds of artifact:

1. llvm-buildsupport-*.tar.gz
   A CMake install tree (headers, CMake package, TableGen binaries) built from
   swiftlang/llvm-project at the pinned commit. Licensed Apache-2.0 WITH
   LLVM-exception. Upstream: https://github.com/swiftlang/llvm-project

2. swift-*-RELEASE-osx.pkg
   A byte-for-byte mirror of the official swift.org toolchain installer, kept
   so builds remain reproducible if swift.org prunes older releases. Licensed
   Apache-2.0 WITH Runtime Library Exception. Unmodified; its SHA256 matches
   the upstream file. Upstream: https://download.swift.org/

Neither artifact is redistributed inside the Mavericks Swift runtime .pkg.
Both are host-side build tooling only.
